    <section id="cs-top">
        <h1>Nexus</h1>
        <h2>How a set of agency AI experiments became shared infrastructure used across the company.</h2>
        <p class="lede">I owned product and technical direction for the system underneath Mod Op's AI work. Nexus handled identity and permissions, along with the agents and organizational knowledge they governed. Nexus Chat put those capabilities in people's hands. Orion gave the platform a clear internal and client-facing story.</p>
    </section>

